---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
    title="Privacy — PixlPut"
    description="What PixlPut does and does not collect. Short answer: nothing about your windows leaves your Mac."
    path="/privacy"
>
    <section class="prose container">
        <h1>Privacy</h1>
        <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> nothing about your windows, files, or activity ever leaves your Mac. PixlPut makes exactly one kind of network call: update checks to <code>updates.pixput.app</code>.</p>

        <h2>What's stored locally</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Snapshots</strong> — window positions, sizes, Desktops, app bundle IDs, and window titles. If you turn on per-app identity, also the browser tab, workspace or project each window shows. Stored in <code>~/Library/Application Support/DisplayMaid-Next/snapshots/</code>. Never transmitted.</li>
            <li><strong>Space thumbnails</strong> — off by default. If you opt in, a JPEG of each Desktop is saved next to your snapshots. Never transmitted.</li>
            <li><strong>Diagnostic log</strong> — a plain-text trace of capture/restore decisions, in <code>~/Library/Application Support/DisplayMaid-Next/logs/</code>. Keeps the last three runs. Never auto-sent; you can attach it to a support email if you choose.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What's sent over the network</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Software updates</strong> — Sparkle checks our appcast for new versions. No identifying data sent beyond a User-Agent.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>No analytics. No crash reporting. No cookies. No third-party SDKs of any kind.</p>

        <h2>Data deletion</h2>
        <p>Delete the snapshots folder above to remove all local data. PixlPut keeps nothing about you anywhere else.</p>

        <p class="updated">Last updated: 2026-10-08</p>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .prose {
        padding: 64px 0;
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .prose h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .prose h2 {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 32px 0 12px;
    }
    .prose p, .prose li {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--text-dim);
    }
    .prose p { margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .prose ul { padding-left: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .prose strong { color: var(--text); }
    .prose code {
        background: var(--surface);
        padding: 2px 6px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 13px;
    }
    .updated {
        margin-top: 48px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--text-dim);
    }
</style>
